---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Be Insiculous — independent game studio">
  <section class="hero">
    <p class="section-label">independent game studio</p>
    <h1>Be Insiculous</h1>
    <p class="lede">
      One developer, a Rust engine, and a long-running habit of building 2D
      games from the metal up.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <p>
      Be Insiculous is a solo studio. After years of independent game and
      engine development, everything here runs on <strong>Insiculous 2D</strong>
      — a 2D engine written in Rust, built for the games I actually want to
      make rather than the ones a general-purpose engine expects. Six arcade
      games in alpha so far — a running take on the 20 Games Challenge —
      each one two-player, each one with the engine's signature escalating
      <em>chaos modes</em>.
    </p>
    <p>
      These days the engine pulls double duty: it powers the games on this
      site and serves as a <a href="/engine/">proving ground for agentic
      coding tools</a> — real tasks on a live, opinionated Rust codebase,
      judged on whether the result actually survives.
    </p>
    <!-- PLACEHOLDER: add a paragraph on current focus (e.g. Deion the Insiculous / web export) when you're ready to talk about it publicly. -->
  </section>

  <section class="cta">
    <a class="button" href="/games/">browse the games →</a>
    <a class="button secondary" href="/devlog/">read the devlog →</a>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .hero {
    padding: 2rem 0 1rem;
  }

  .lede {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    color: var(--text-bright);
    max-width: 34em;
  }

  section p {
    max-width: 42em;
  }

  .cta {
    margin-top: 2.5rem;
    display: flex;
    gap: 1rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  .button {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    padding: 0.6rem 1.1rem;
    border-radius: 6px;
    background: var(--accent);
    color: var(--bg);
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .button:hover {
    text-decoration: none;
    filter: brightness(1.1);
  }

  .button.secondary {
    background: transparent;
    color: var(--accent);
    border: 1px solid var(--accent-dim);
    font-weight: 500;
  }
</style>
